UC009 .> UC011 : <<include>>
UC009 .> UC013 : <<include>>
UC011 .> UC012 : <<extend>>
UC013 .> UC014 : <<extend>>
GitClient --> UC015
GitClient --> UC016
GitClient --> UC017
GitClient --> UC018
GitClient --> UC019
GitClient --> UC021
UC006 .> UC023 : <<include>>
UC009 .> UC023 : <<include>>
